cil de entender, mas as vezes as pessoas gostam de se fazer de burras pra viver na fantasia e fazer o que o ser humano mas sabe fazer: nao reconhecer que estão errados. Parabéns pelo resumo", "timestamp": 1793047486, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "batista.analisa2", "author_id": "45974619589", "id": "18120673111970818", "text": "Agora aguenta o ex condenado por mais 4 anos no poder", "timestamp": 1793031235, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "jeftavas", "author_id": "29375802650", "id": "18097174214665101", "text": "Uma bela \"justiça\"", "timestamp": 1793029148, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "fernsantos__", "author_id": "65636668919", "id": "18012772427994536", "text": "👏👏", "timestamp": 1793028215, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "mel_barros.ebc", "author_id": "174746358", "id": "18105414593566516", "text": "Vergonha", "timestamp": 1793027153, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "v_palmares", "author_id": "392289221", "id": "18197034004391924", "text": "E continua roubando!", "timestamp": 1793025075, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "gmde1988", "author_id": "68667707458", "id": "18346503025280121", "text": "Mas em 2027, ninguém vai escapar do Split Payment.\nAumento de 24% em todos serviços e produtos.\n😊🤗😊🤗😊🤗😊🤗", "timestamp": 1793022563, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/De4uxy0xC1m/", "webpage_url_basename": "De4uxy0xC1m", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://scontent-iad3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/865945045_18422638660153263_9945501925345754_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=101&ig_cache_key=NDAxNTE2NDc5OTc2NzAzMTE0MjE4NDIyNjM4NjU3MTUzMjYz.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEwODAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=1eKLEDaB5GUQ7kNvwECDx39&_nc_oc=AdoyJAZ3ubR3WOHgPzIKmgEwSmLWBJNAe-CIhjLX6dB3Dhr9w2wmQtOJolAsKNKgX1o&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=d3DRDBOWodf5Bapaanz6bQ&_nc_ss=70